#: ../../source/docs/common-NxtPX4v2.rst:81 ed6bfa8102c9480e92d9efc7ca618da9
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NxtPX4v2.rst:83 9ccc50db95d248cc94b98135da6c8d16
msgid ""
"The default RC input is configured on the UART5 by default. The SBUS pin is "
"inverted and connected to RX5. Non SBUS,  single wire serial inputs can be "
"directly tied to RX5 if SBUS pin is left unconnected. RC could  be applied "
"instead at a different UART port such as UART2, UART4 or UART8, and set the "
"protocol to receive RC data: ``SERIALn_PROTOCOL=23`` and change SERIAL6 "
"_Protocol to something other than '23'."
msgstr ""
"默认 RC 输入配置在 UART5 上。SBUS 引脚经反相后连接至 RX5。非 SBUS 的单线串行输入，若 SBUS 引脚悬空，可直接连接至 "
"RX5。也可将 RC 改接至其他 UART 端口（如 UART2、UART4 或 UART8），并将对应协议设为 "
"``SERIALn_PROTOCOL=23``，同时将 SERIAL6_Protocol 更改为非「23」的协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NxtPX4v2.rst:85 b8335166cb144c1fb65e294c6324f4bf
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NxtPX4v2.rst:87 2233e2fb9cd142ceb97842302887d609
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to the Tx5 of the UART and "
":ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"7\"."
msgstr ""
"FPort 需连接至 UART 的 Tx5 引脚，并将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设为「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NxtPX4v2.rst:89 801b24605cf9400facf747507e8ecacb
msgid ""
"CRSF/ELRS also requires a TXx5 connection, and automatically provides "
"telemetry. Set  :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` = \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF/ELRS 还需 TXx5 连接，并自动提供数传。请将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` "
"设为「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NxtPX4v2.rst:91 2ec56c9eb3b74a43b91a77d6226b7191
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to Tx5 and automatically provides telemetry.  "
"Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` =  \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需连接至 Tx5 并自动提供数传。请将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NxtPX4v2.rst:94 ccc8f32267a644a29722ae870ab53cb7
msgid "HD VTX Support"
msgstr "高清图传支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NxtPX4v2.rst:96 ecba0a24561742249abd24df3f842ed5
msgid ""
"The SH1.0-6P connector supports a DJI Air Unit / HD VTX connection. Protocol"
" defaults to DisplayPort. Pin 1 of the connector is 12v so be careful not to"
" connect this to a peripheral requiring 5v."
msgstr ""
"SH1.0-6P 接头支持 DJI Air Unit/高清图传连接。协议默认为 DisplayPort。接头的第 1 针为 12V，请勿将其连接到需要 "
"5V 的外设。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NxtPX4v2.rst:99 eb7c76f1e1214b87a4694cfa355230df
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NxtPX4v2.rst:101 7d4f3eda3de7411489bebffa7ebc05d4
msgid ""
"The NxtPX4v2 supports up to 8 PWM outputs. All channels support bi-"
"directional DShot. PWM outputs are grouped and within each group the same "
"same output protocol must be used:"
msgstr "NxtPX4v2 最多支持 8 路 PWM 输出。所有通道均支持双向 DShot。PWM 输出按组划分，每组必须使用相同的输出协议："

#: ../../source/docs/common-NxtPX4v2.rst:103 9ff41eab27574301b2f46ca5c8636927
msgid "1 - 4 are Group1;"
msgstr "1-4 属于第 1 组；"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NxtPX4v2.rst:104 58ac0d62f5414110871c13971da4082c
msgid "5, 6 are Group2;"
msgstr "5、6 属于第 2 组；"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NxtPX4v2.rst:105 b3155be29a1b42e8b8ef5dcdb8ac5cc1
msgid "7, 8 are Group3;"
msgstr "7、8 属于第 3 组；"

