#: ../../source/docs/common-NxtPX4v2.rst:110 69960a289f9c4ecb95e358fc9dffffac
msgid ""
"The board has a internal voltage sensor and connections on the ESC connector"
" for an external current sensor input. The voltage sensor can handle up to "
"6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "该飞控板内置电压传感器，ESC 接头上有外部电流传感器输入接口。电压传感器支持最高 6S 锂电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NxtPX4v2.rst:113 982f2a57f31c46e1a9704de63d9dfb53
msgid "The default battery parameters are:"
msgstr "默认电池参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-NxtPX4v2.rst:118 6ee8f36aaa36419891594776a5ce9882
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor via the VBAT pin, but no internal "
"current sensor. An external current sensor can be connected to the Curr pin."
" Default parameters for both internal voltage and external current "
"monitoring are set by default to :"
msgstr ""
"该飞控板通过 VBAT 引脚内置电压传感器，但无内部电流传感器。外部电流传感器可连接至 Curr 引脚。内部电压和外部电流监测的默认参数已预设为："

