"attached to the STM32H743. The numbering of the GPIOs for use in ArduPilot "
"Relay and other GPIO functions are:"
msgstr ""
"AUX 接头上有 3 路 GPIO 输出，直接连接至 STM32H743。ArduPilot 继电器和其他 GPIO 功能中 GPIO 的编号为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-NxtPX4v2.rst:137 34b8df51d6884514a598d23b3fce1164
